# .claude/uroboro.tags
# Project-specific uroboro capture convention

project: uroboro

tags:
  dogfood       — uroboro building/improving itself
  enforcement   — capture compliance, hook system, audit mechanisms
  mcp           — MCP server tools, protocol, integration
  cli           — CLI commands, shell interface
  distill       — style distillation, prompt profiling
  presentation  — landing page, docs, public-facing material

capture-triggers:
  - Self-referential moments where uroboro captures its own development (tag: dogfood)
  - Decisions about how to enforce capture compliance (tag: enforcement)
  - MCP tool design choices (tag: mcp)
  - The tool documenting its own limitations or gaps (tag: dogfood)

format: concise, technical — these captures inform future development
